@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor transparent
skinparam defaultFontName "Malgun Gothic"
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceArrowColor #334155
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBorderColor #64748B
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #334155
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #F8FAFC
skinparam sequenceGroupBorderColor #64748B
title 한국어 표시 컬럼 일괄 번역

actor 운영자 as U
participant "TranslationMain" as MAIN
participant "SakeTranslator" as T
participant "TranslationRepository" as R
participant "GeminiTranslator" as AI
database "MySQL" as DB
U -> MAIN : 번역 도구 실행
MAIN -> T : translate()
loop 제품명 미번역 배치
  T -> R : findUntranslatedSakeNames(limit)
  R -> DB : name_ko IS NULL
  DB --> T : no, name_ja, name_kana
  T -> T : HTML 주석·태그 정리
  T -> AI : structured JSON batch 요청
  AI --> T : no + nameKo 배열
  T -> T : 개수·no·중복·빈값 검증
  T -> R : updateSakeNameKo(...)
  R -> DB : name_ko IS NULL인 행만 UPDATE
end
loop 쌀·효모의 DISTINCT 미번역 값
  T -> R : findUntranslatedRice/Yeast(limit)
  R -> DB : DISTINCT 값 + *_ko IS NULL
  DB --> T : 고유 원문
  T -> AI : structured JSON batch 요청
  AI --> T : id + valueKo 배열
  T -> T : 요청 id·개수·중복·빈값 검증
  T -> R : updateRiceKo / updateYeastKo
  R -> DB : 같은 원문의 미번역 행 갱신
end
MAIN --> U : 처리 현황 출력
@enduml
